{{also|wurst}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|wurst}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wurstiz}}. Could possibly be related to the verb {{m|de|wirren}} (from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wers-}}), which would point to an original meaning of "mixture".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vʊʁst/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Wurst.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Würste|Würstchen}}

